{"seq":1,"slug":"byol-simsiam","title":"BYOL 与 SimSiam","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/non-contrastive/byol-simsiam","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"byol-与-simsiam\">BYOL 与 SimSiam</h1><p>对比学习的整套逻辑建立在一个信条上：没有负样本，模型就会把一切映射到同一个点而坍缩。2020 年 BYOL 直接挑战了这个信条——它根本不用负样本，却学到了超越 SimCLR 的表示。这个结果当时震动了整个领域，因为它推翻了「负样本是防坍缩的必要条件」。随后 SimSiam 把 BYOL 拆到最简，证明连动量编码器都不需要，一个停止梯度操作就够了。这两个工作重新定义了「坍缩从何而来」这个根本问题。这一篇讲清它们为什么不坍缩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>BYOL 和 SimSiam 都是「孪生网络预测自己」的结构：同一图的两个增强分别过两个分支，让一个分支去预测另一个分支的输出。既然两个分支都在学同一个东西，最平凡的解就是两个分支都输出常数——即坍缩。它们防坍缩靠的不是负样本，而是结构上的不对称：一个分支多一个预测器（predictor），另一个分支的梯度被切断（stop-gradient）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一张图 x] --&gt; B[增强1 → 在线编码器 → 投影 → 预测器 → p]&#10;    A --&gt; C[增强2 → 目标编码器 → 投影 → z]&#10;    C --&gt; D[stop-gradient 切断梯度]&#10;    B --&gt; E[最小化 p 与 z 的负余弦相似度]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[BYOL: 目标编码器 EMA 更新]&#10;    E --&gt; G[SimSiam: 目标=在线编码器共享权重]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一张图 x] --&gt; B[增强1 → 在线编码器 → 投影 → 预测器 → p]\n    A --&gt; C[增强2 → 目标编码器 → 投影 → z]\n    C --&gt; D[stop-gradient 切断梯度]\n    B --&gt; E[最小化 p 与 z 的负余弦相似度]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[BYOL: 目标编码器 EMA 更新]\n    E --&gt; G[SimSiam: 目标=在线编码器共享权重]</pre><h2 id=\"byol-在线网络预测动量目标\">BYOL：在线网络预测动量目标</h2><p>BYOL（Bootstrap Your Own Latent）有两个网络：在线网络（online）和目标网络（target）。在线网络包含编码器、投影头、再加一个预测头；目标网络只有编码器和投影头，没有预测头。训练目标是让在线网络的预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 匹配目标网络的投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，损失是归一化后的均方误差（等价于负余弦相似度）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>BYOL</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∥</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∥</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{BYOL}} = \\left\\lVert \\frac{p}{\\lVert p \\rVert} - \\frac{z}{\\lVert z \\rVert} \\right\\rVert^2 = 2 - 2 \\cdot \\frac{\\langle p, z \\rangle}{\\lVert p \\rVert \\lVert z \\rVert}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">BYOL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键有两点。其一，目标网络不走梯度，用在线网络的指数滑动平均更新（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>←</mo><mi>m</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>online</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{target}} \\leftarrow m\\,\\theta_{\\text{target}} + (1-m)\\,\\theta_{\\text{online}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">online</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），这个动量机制与 <a href=\"../contrastive/simclr-moco\">SimCLR 与 MoCo</a> 的动量编码器同源。其二，只有在线网络有预测头，造成两分支不对称。直觉上，目标网络提供一个缓慢移动、不会一起坍缩的「锚」，在线网络去追它，预测头则吸收两个增强视角间的差异，使得「都输出常数」不再是损失下降的最优路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"simsiam-停止梯度就够了\">SimSiam：停止梯度就够了</h2><p>SimSiam（Simple Siamese）做了一个极简的消融：去掉 BYOL 的动量目标网络，两个分支直接共享同一套权重。它发现只要保留预测头和停止梯度，依然不坍缩。损失对称化：两个视角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1, x_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 各算一次预测，互为目标，但目标侧都加停止梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>SimSiam</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>sg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>sg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{SimSiam}} = \\frac{1}{2} D(p_1, \\text{sg}(z_2)) + \\frac{1}{2} D(p_2, \\text{sg}(z_1))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SimSiam</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sg</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sg</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是负余弦相似度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是停止梯度。SimSiam 的论文给出一个解释：停止梯度让训练隐式地变成一个类似 EM 算法的交替优化——一侧固定当「目标」，另一侧去拟合，再交换。这种交替阻止了两分支同步坍缩。消融实验证明：去掉预测头会立刻坍缩，去掉停止梯度也会立刻坍缩，两者缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不坍缩-机制对照\">为什么不坍缩：机制对照</h2><p>BYOL 和 SimSiam 揭示了防坍缩的多条路径，与对比学习的负样本路径并列。下表对照三种防坍缩机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>防坍缩机制</th>\n<th>是否用负样本</th>\n<th>是否用动量编码器</th>\n<th>关键组件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SimCLR/MoCo</td>\n<td>负样本提供均匀性</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>MoCo 是</td>\n<td>大批量/队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BYOL</td>\n<td>动量目标 + 预测器</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>预测头、EMA 目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SimSiam</td>\n<td>停止梯度 + 预测器</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>预测头、stop-gradient</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心洞见是：坍缩的真正解药不是负样本本身，而是「打破两分支的对称性、阻止它们同步退化」。负样本是一种打破方式（推远），预测器加停止梯度是另一种。这个认识把 <a href=\"../contrastive/contrastive-objectives\">对比损失与 InfoNCE</a> 里的均匀性约束相对化了——它是充分而非必要条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程要点与影响\">工程要点与影响</h2><p>非对比方法有几个实践优势：不需要大批量（SimSiam 用 256 批量即可）、不需要维护负样本队列、不受 <a href=\"../contrastive/negatives-augmentation\">负样本与数据增强</a> 里假负样本问题困扰。但它们对超参更敏感——预测头的学习率、BatchNorm 的位置、动量系数都可能影响是否坍缩，调试时第一件事就是用 <a href=\"../foundations/representation-eval\">表示评估与探针</a> 里的特征秩或标准差监控是否正在坍缩。</p>\n<p>BYOL 的「预测目标网络」思想直接启发了后续的自蒸馏方法，下一篇的 <a href=\"clustering-methods\">聚类方法 SwAV 与 DINO</a> 里，DINO 正是把这套「学生追教师」的框架推向了 ViT 和语义注意力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><p>非对比方法的实现看似简单，几处细节错了就会直接坍缩：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去掉预测头</td>\n<td>两分支对称，立刻坍缩</td>\n<td>预测头是打破对称的关键，消融证明缺它即坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去掉停止梯度</td>\n<td>梯度经目标侧回流，同样坍缩</td>\n<td>预测头与停止梯度缺一不可，两者共同维持不对称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把非对比等同于免调参</td>\n<td>超参敏感，学习率/BN 位置都可能致坍缩</td>\n<td>训练时需持续监控特征秩或标准差，而非只盯损失曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认为负样本完全无用</td>\n<td>误读结论为「负样本是错的」</td>\n<td>结论是负样本非唯一路径，均匀性约束仍是有力机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>坍缩往往在损失曲线上看不出来，所以判断标准不该是损失，而是表示的特征分布是否退化——这与评估篇的坍缩诊断直接呼应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BYOL 与 SimSiam 不用负样本却不坍缩，推翻了「负样本是防坍缩必要条件」的信条。</li>\n<li>BYOL 用在线网络预测 EMA 动量目标，靠预测头加动量目标的不对称防坍缩；损失是归一化 MSE（负余弦相似度）。</li>\n<li>SimSiam 去掉动量目标、共享权重，仅靠预测头加停止梯度即可防坍缩；消融证明两者缺一即坍缩。</li>\n<li>核心洞见：防坍缩的本质是打破两分支对称、阻止同步退化，负样本只是其中一种方式而非唯一；非对比法省去大批量与假负样本之忧，但对超参更敏感。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BYOL 与 SimSiam","id":"byol-与-simsiam"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BYOL：在线网络预测动量目标","id":"byol-在线网络预测动量目标"},{"level":2,"text":"SimSiam：停止梯度就够了","id":"simsiam-停止梯度就够了"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不坍缩：机制对照","id":"为什么不坍缩-机制对照"},{"level":2,"text":"工程要点与影响","id":"工程要点与影响"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"负样本与数据增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/contrastive/negatives-augmentation"},"next":{"title":"聚类方法 SwAV 与 DINO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/non-contrastive/clustering-methods"}}